Readplace for Android keeps the articles you save in one place to read. Share a link from any app to save it and choose its readlists. Your reading list shows To Read and Read, with your readlists beside them. Read in the app, highlight passages, add notes, and let Next Read take you on. When a site won't let Readplace in, the app copies the page from your phone so the article is still saved. Where the law requires it, Google Play confirms your age before you sign in.
